# The alternate UI bundle. `dist/` above does not cover it: the mounted bundle
# is built to its own outDir on purpose, so that a stale TM8_UI_DIR pointing at
# the alternate package fails loudly instead of serving an index whose every
# asset 404s (packages/tm8_ui_2.0/vite.config.ts says why at length).
#
# `dist-2.0` since 2026-09-03, when the roles swapped and packages/tm8-ui took
# the root back. `dist-1.0` stays listed: it is what the alternate bundle was
# called while packages/tm8_ui_2.0 held the root, and a checkout that predates
# the swap still has one on disk.
dist-1.0/
dist-2.0/
